WEBVTT

00:01.610 --> 00:04.150
I get to spend the School Festival with Ayako-san.

00:04.150 --> 00:06.650
I want to make fun memories with her.

00:06.650 --> 00:07.870
That’s what I thought.

00:07.870 --> 00:09.690
Together... Together...

00:10.740 --> 00:12.820
I was selfish.

00:14.070 --> 00:18.440
I completely didn’t realize that she was sick.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:50.020 --> 01:55.050
Hearts Together

01:59.650 --> 02:00.720
Come in.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.850
Ayako-san...

02:10.850 --> 02:11.780
Mamoru?

02:11.780 --> 02:13.640
Why did you push yourself so hard?

02:15.170 --> 02:17.600
I ruined things for you, didn’t I?

02:18.520 --> 02:20.790
Don’t say things like that.

02:26.690 --> 02:28.300
Brother...

02:28.300 --> 02:31.270
She has a temperature of 103.1.

02:31.270 --> 02:33.830
She shouldn’t be up and about right now.

02:33.830 --> 02:35.540
That’s not true.

02:35.540 --> 02:36.300
I’m just fine.

02:36.300 --> 02:38.220
Ayako-san, no...

02:44.980 --> 02:47.820
Why did this happen?

02:49.340 --> 02:52.090
According to Professor Horikawa,

02:52.620 --> 02:56.650
when Ayako was eleven,
she collapsed from fever then, too.

02:56.650 --> 02:57.990
Eleven?

03:00.830 --> 03:05.230
She unconsciously controls the beatrice within her.

03:05.230 --> 03:07.650
It’s nearly another body part now.

03:08.360 --> 03:12.700
It’s possible that her growth has confused the beatrice.

03:13.220 --> 03:15.480
Her growth?

03:15.480 --> 03:17.950
Oh, I see...

03:20.820 --> 03:22.710
The professor said

03:22.710 --> 03:27.970
my body might have stopped growing completely.

03:27.970 --> 03:30.330
So the beatrice could be uncertain

03:30.330 --> 03:34.640
about the changes my body’s going through.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.110
It’s stupid.

03:38.250 --> 03:40.030
Her body’s growing?

03:41.190 --> 03:44.760
He said not to worry.

03:44.760 --> 03:46.340
If she stays off her feet for a while,

03:46.340 --> 03:49.520
the beatrice will regain its balance,
and she’ll recover.

03:49.520 --> 03:54.330
But he says it’ll take at least three days.

03:54.330 --> 03:55.290
Three days?

03:56.800 --> 03:58.580
But that’s not enough time.

03:58.580 --> 04:01.380
The School Fair is tomorrow and the next day.

04:02.590 --> 04:04.760
If her fever doesn’t go down,

04:04.760 --> 04:07.260
we’ll have to do <i>Sleeping Beauty </i>without her.

04:07.860 --> 04:11.240
We’ll have to get one of the drama
club members to replace her.

04:15.830 --> 04:20.870
<i>I doubt I’ve ever looked forward to a festival this much.</i>

04:25.410 --> 04:28.030
We should get going.

04:28.030 --> 04:29.200
Yeah.

04:29.200 --> 04:32.030
I’ll stay here a while longer.

04:32.030 --> 04:32.910
Understood.

04:39.130 --> 04:40.340
Mamoru...

04:41.760 --> 04:43.220
You sleep.

04:43.220 --> 04:44.930
I’ll be here.

04:52.170 --> 04:55.210
<i>She’s cute when she’s asleep.</i>

04:55.860 --> 04:57.900
<i>What am I thinking, at a time like this?</i>

05:07.570 --> 05:09.190
<i>Her diary?</i>

05:10.620 --> 05:12.180
<i>I can’t look.</i>

05:18.000 --> 05:23.860
10/30: I’m so embarrassed, I can’t look at Mamoru.

05:23.860 --> 05:25.410
It’s sad.

05:25.410 --> 05:30.610
10/31: I’m so nervous, I can’t talk to him.

05:30.610 --> 05:36.940
11/10: That stupid president,
screwing around with Mamoru.

05:36.940 --> 05:43.860
11/11: Mamoru insisted,
so I accepted the role of the heroine.

05:46.590 --> 05:48.490
The best day of my life!

05:48.490 --> 05:49.950
This is...

05:50.190 --> 05:51.670
Takasu-san...

05:52.540 --> 05:53.790
<i>Ayako-san!</i>

05:55.120 --> 05:58.290
<i>Please be my girlfriend.</i>

06:00.750 --> 06:02.020
That was the day.

06:02.020 --> 06:05.430
That was the best day of her life.

06:11.890 --> 06:13.270
Ayako-san...

06:18.520 --> 06:20.770
Ayako-san, does it hurt?

06:21.340 --> 06:22.690
It’s OK.

06:22.690 --> 06:27.310
I want to go to the School Fair with you,

06:27.310 --> 06:29.950
so I won’t give up, no matter what.

06:33.870 --> 06:38.310
I want to give you a present of the best School Fair ever.

06:43.750 --> 06:46.170
Mamoru, it’s finally time.

06:46.170 --> 06:48.720
Everyone else comes tomorrow.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.890
Today, it’s just students and teachers.

06:51.790 --> 06:53.670
It says <i>Sleeping Beauty.</i>

06:53.670 --> 06:55.810
I love this story.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.220
What’s wrong?

06:58.220 --> 06:59.290
You OK?

06:59.290 --> 07:00.400
It’s nothing.

07:00.400 --> 07:04.510
Mamoru, can I enter the beauty contest?

07:05.360 --> 07:06.770
I-I don’t know.

07:06.770 --> 07:09.420
Get going. It’s nearly time, right?

07:09.420 --> 07:11.580
You’re making her wait, aren’t you?

07:12.580 --> 07:14.250
Yeah, thanks.

07:15.750 --> 07:18.510
I told her I wouldn’t give up,

07:18.510 --> 07:21.070
but I don’t know what to do.

07:21.070 --> 07:22.620
Yes, hello.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.560
OK, OK.

07:25.560 --> 07:27.060
Understood.

07:27.060 --> 07:29.210
Mamoru, it’s Takasu-san.

07:29.210 --> 07:31.120
Is there something wrong with her?

07:31.120 --> 07:33.530
She sounds really sick...

07:34.680 --> 07:35.850
Hello.

07:35.850 --> 07:37.640
It’s me, Mamoru.

07:38.810 --> 07:40.950
I figured you’d be worrying yourself silly

07:40.950 --> 07:46.310
over something stupid involving me.

07:46.310 --> 07:51.200
You guys do the play today yourselves.

07:51.720 --> 07:55.560
If it’s awful today and gets a bad reputation,

07:55.560 --> 07:58.910
no one will come see me tomorrow.

07:58.910 --> 08:00.370
Tomorrow...

08:01.820 --> 08:04.710
I’ll do what I can.

08:05.180 --> 08:09.340
So, Mamoru, you do what you can.

08:09.340 --> 08:11.080
Don’t worry.

08:11.080 --> 08:14.090
If you try to pity me, I’ll be mad.

08:14.090 --> 08:15.450
I believe you.

08:16.340 --> 08:24.310
You’re going to give me the
best School Fair ever, right?

08:25.010 --> 08:27.360
So I’m OK.

08:27.360 --> 08:29.020
I’m sure it’ll be fine.

08:29.020 --> 08:30.250
There’s a way...

08:30.870 --> 08:35.260
I think there’s a way to get rid of this fever.

08:35.260 --> 08:37.230
If we think about it together,

08:37.230 --> 08:40.720
even if we don’t have anything now, we’ll have something by tomorrow.

08:41.170 --> 08:45.300
So for now, Mamoru, don’t think about anything else.

08:46.740 --> 08:48.110
Do your best.

09:00.850 --> 09:02.730
Approaching final stop.

09:02.730 --> 09:05.310
Beatrice University High School.

09:19.330 --> 09:22.160
I am his true fiancée.

09:22.680 --> 09:26.460
You’re merely the one his parents chose!

09:28.430 --> 09:32.170
And you’re just after his power!

09:32.780 --> 09:34.090
Um...

09:34.680 --> 09:37.190
The prince says that social class means nothing

09:37.190 --> 09:39.220
when it comes to love!

09:39.650 --> 09:41.350
What do you mean?

09:41.350 --> 09:44.540
My brother’s always like that.

09:44.540 --> 09:46.950
He sucks up to everyone...

09:46.950 --> 09:51.190
But that’s what makes me love him.

09:51.910 --> 09:57.970
As his tutor, I’ve watched over him
since he was quite young.

09:57.970 --> 09:59.640
I think I’d be best.

09:59.640 --> 10:02.200
Wait, those aren’t the lines...

10:05.780 --> 10:07.080
No!

10:07.080 --> 10:08.660
The prince...

10:09.270 --> 10:12.630
Yagi’s the one who loves him most.

10:12.630 --> 10:14.630
This is awful.

10:17.910 --> 10:19.370
It’s almost your turn.

10:22.010 --> 10:23.410
President...

10:24.930 --> 10:27.450
There must be some way.

10:27.450 --> 10:29.770
But I can’t find it.

10:29.770 --> 10:33.740
I want Ayako-san to come, no matter what.

10:35.720 --> 10:37.450
Prince!

10:40.870 --> 10:42.800
Get going.

10:43.260 --> 10:44.420
All right.

10:45.580 --> 10:47.490
Princess, where are you?

10:57.530 --> 10:59.460
Yoshimura-sama, get in.

10:59.460 --> 11:00.170
I’ll give you a ride.

11:00.170 --> 11:02.050
Thank you.

11:11.070 --> 11:12.150
Excuse us.

11:18.810 --> 11:21.490
I’ll bring something to drink.

11:21.490 --> 11:22.980
Thank you.

11:32.410 --> 11:33.870
She’s hot.

11:41.180 --> 11:43.410
I know. Maybe...

11:44.380 --> 11:45.140
Come in.

11:45.140 --> 11:46.920
Excuse me.

11:46.920 --> 11:49.680
Sudou-sama is here.

11:49.680 --> 11:51.240
President...

11:55.130 --> 11:56.430
Here’s a present for you.

11:59.460 --> 12:01.220
This is Ayako-san?

12:01.220 --> 12:02.330
Yes.

12:02.330 --> 12:04.830
Someone in the arts and crafts club was selling them.

12:04.830 --> 12:06.440
So I bought one.

12:06.440 --> 12:08.790
Don’t you think it’s made well?

12:09.160 --> 12:10.240
Yes.

12:13.370 --> 12:14.390
How’s her fever?

12:14.390 --> 12:16.800
I think it’s gone down a bit.

12:16.800 --> 12:18.210
But I haven’t measured it.

12:21.260 --> 12:24.790
I came up with an idea.

12:25.720 --> 12:32.580
This happened to her because of
the beatrice’s confusion, right?

12:33.160 --> 12:37.680
So can’t we just control the beatrice?

12:37.680 --> 12:40.590
We could tell it that it’s confused and off-balance,

12:41.300 --> 12:47.180
and that it should go back to normal...

12:49.050 --> 12:52.320
When Ayako-san and I were attacked...

12:53.620 --> 12:55.310
<i>Stop it!</i>

12:58.530 --> 13:03.780
The beatrice inside him answered me.

13:03.780 --> 13:07.400
I thought I might be able to...

13:07.400 --> 13:11.900
To send an external impulse to her body’s beatrice...

13:12.500 --> 13:14.000
I thought of that, too.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.520
And?

13:15.520 --> 13:17.440
Is it possible?

13:17.440 --> 13:19.040
It is.

13:21.780 --> 13:24.070
But there are drawbacks.

13:27.530 --> 13:33.220
It’s dangerous to manipulate the
beatrice in someone’s body.

13:34.060 --> 13:36.330
Any mistake...

13:37.240 --> 13:38.500
Mistake?

13:38.500 --> 13:41.450
To be honest, it’s a big risk.

13:42.170 --> 13:45.010
I’d rather not do it.

13:45.010 --> 13:47.670
I thought of that, as well.

13:47.670 --> 13:48.930
Ayako-san?

13:48.930 --> 13:52.100
Ayako... You were awake?

13:52.100 --> 13:56.980
I thought it might be the only way.

13:59.050 --> 14:00.760
Are you OK?

14:00.760 --> 14:02.200
Thank you.

14:02.200 --> 14:06.280
So all three of us settled on the same idea.

14:06.280 --> 14:08.290
You can’t mean...

14:08.290 --> 14:09.960
Rethink it, Ayako.

14:09.960 --> 14:11.580
I feel bad about the School Fair,

14:11.580 --> 14:15.100
but a few more days of rest,
and you’ll recover.

14:15.100 --> 14:18.120
There’s no need to take the chance.

14:18.120 --> 14:19.420
Be quiet.

14:20.210 --> 14:22.300
“Stay there, not doing anything,

14:22.300 --> 14:23.630
because there may be bad consequences.”

14:24.100 --> 14:28.180
Those aren’t the words of the man
who encouraged me a year ago,

14:28.180 --> 14:30.310
during the duel with the Dark Lord of Prussia.

14:31.770 --> 14:33.140
Prussia!

14:33.140 --> 14:37.010
That, along with the experiment, taught me better!

14:37.010 --> 14:38.750
I don’t want you to...

14:43.570 --> 14:46.620
I guess nothing I say will matter.

14:47.650 --> 14:52.450
I don’t want the School Festival to
end like this, unfinished...

14:52.450 --> 14:54.730
I agree.

14:55.710 --> 15:01.880
But he’s right. If something happened to you, I’d...

15:02.550 --> 15:04.700
You gave me your word, right?

15:04.700 --> 15:06.510
That you’d never give up.

15:08.520 --> 15:10.250
So we’ll do it.

15:10.250 --> 15:12.870
I’ll help as much as I can.

15:13.400 --> 15:15.410
You talk to the beatrice inside me,

15:15.410 --> 15:17.550
and I’m sure it’ll work out.

15:17.550 --> 15:20.350
The two us together...

15:20.350 --> 15:21.770
Together.

15:25.590 --> 15:28.470
I don’t want to quit, either.

15:28.470 --> 15:32.160
I still want to give you the
best School Festival ever!

15:33.910 --> 15:35.580
Mamoru...

15:38.960 --> 15:41.210
I won’t tell you to stop anymore.

15:41.210 --> 15:44.060
But I will make one suggestion.

15:44.060 --> 15:46.330
For now, at least,

15:46.330 --> 15:49.290
I’m Mamoru-kun’s superior at beatrice control.

15:49.760 --> 15:52.890
I can do it instead.

15:52.890 --> 15:55.640
He’s got more talent than you.

15:55.640 --> 15:57.170
Ayako-san.

15:58.640 --> 16:01.340
If I help him, I know it’ll work.

16:01.340 --> 16:04.750
I don’t know why, but I’m sure.

16:04.750 --> 16:06.230
I’ll make certain it works.

16:06.230 --> 16:07.670
OK.

16:08.250 --> 16:10.440
Mamoru-kun, take good care of her.

16:20.210 --> 16:23.590
Mamoru, are you ready?

16:23.590 --> 16:24.410
Yes.

16:25.000 --> 16:28.250
The most important part of controlling beatrice is...

16:28.250 --> 16:30.050
Concentration.

16:30.400 --> 16:33.540
Do what I tell you.

16:33.540 --> 16:36.970
Close your eyes, and focus your mind.

16:37.880 --> 16:38.890
OK.

16:39.370 --> 16:40.990
You can do it.

16:41.560 --> 16:46.610
Remember how it felt to join your mind to the beatrice.

16:56.060 --> 16:57.570
Come here, Mamoru.

17:01.580 --> 17:06.400
Beatrice is the one power that lets
humanity create miracles.

17:06.400 --> 17:10.530
If there’s something you truly desire,
it can grant any wish.

17:13.660 --> 17:15.110
Ayako-san...

17:27.640 --> 17:29.030
<i>Mamoru...</i>

17:39.110 --> 17:40.330
<i>Ayako-san.</i>

17:41.150 --> 17:43.040
<i>I love you.</i>

17:43.040 --> 17:47.100
<i>I don’t even know why I love you so much.</i>

17:47.100 --> 17:49.500
<i>I just do.</i>

17:49.500 --> 17:51.970
<i>I want you by my side, holding me,</i>

17:51.970 --> 17:54.450
<i>and I want to help the School Festival succeed.</i>

17:54.450 --> 17:57.260
<i>I love you, too, Ayako-san.</i>

17:57.260 --> 18:00.430
<i>Let’s make the School Festival a success together.</i>

18:39.140 --> 18:40.590
Ayako!

18:43.260 --> 18:46.520
You still seem to have a small fever.

18:46.520 --> 18:49.370
I guess it’ll be OK.

18:49.370 --> 18:54.180
Oh, my... Did you think I was going to kiss you?

18:58.780 --> 19:00.890
Don’t worry.

19:00.890 --> 19:03.620
See? I’m in perfect shape.

19:03.620 --> 19:05.620
Let’s go, Mamoru.

19:08.540 --> 19:10.530
Ayako, I’m so happy for you.

19:11.750 --> 19:14.260
<i>Thank you, Shione.</i>

19:14.260 --> 19:17.270
Sleeping
Beauty

19:24.100 --> 19:25.600
What do you think?

19:25.600 --> 19:27.930
It’s so pretty...

19:33.070 --> 19:35.770
Emotion!

19:35.770 --> 19:37.790
We will now begin

19:37.790 --> 19:41.490
the drama club’s performance of <i>Sleeping Beauty</i>.

19:47.570 --> 19:49.070
Harsh!

20:18.450 --> 20:20.280
Wait, that’s...

20:21.720 --> 20:23.320
<i>What should I do?</i>

20:28.030 --> 20:29.360
Well?

20:29.360 --> 20:30.990
No complaints now, huh?

20:32.830 --> 20:35.340
<i>I decided my first kiss would be romantic,</i>

20:35.340 --> 20:39.250
<i>by the sea, with a setting sun...</i>

20:54.730 --> 20:56.780
A kiss?!

21:03.280 --> 21:09.030
Mamoru, thank you for the
best School Festival ever!

21:13.660 --> 21:15.460
So I’ll give you one in return.

21:20.500 --> 21:21.660
Mamoru...

21:25.250 --> 21:27.050
She’s fallen...

21:31.110 --> 21:36.190
She’s fallen quite far, the Witch Beatrice.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.950 --> 23:18.680
Someone said that your head will go “kin”

23:18.680 --> 23:20.910
if you put ice in your mouth.

23:20.910 --> 23:23.650
Japanese is a mysterious language.

23:23.650 --> 23:26.830
What is this “kin”?

23:27.310 --> 23:33.540
Kin means gold, which can be exchanged for goods and services.

23:33.540 --> 23:35.920
And while there’s some difference,

23:35.920 --> 23:40.160
in both cases, girls are said to be weak to men who have it.

23:40.660 --> 23:43.940
Next time: Ice Maiden.
